Implement user story EPAM-065: Slash Command: /export

## Story Description
Add `/export` to the REPL so users can export a session transcript and summary as a durable artifact for audit, stakeholder handoff, or delivery reporting.

## Acceptance Criteria
- `/export` is registered in SlashCommands.ts
- The command exports the current session transcript with provider/model and token/cost summary
- At least one structured output format is supported such as Markdown or JSON
- Secrets and sensitive credential material are not emitted in exported output
- Unit tests cover registration and export payload generation

